<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_section"><a href="#S9" title="In Preventing Catastrophic Forgetting: Behavior-Aware Sampling for Safer Language Model Fine-Tuning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">9 </span>Ethical Considerations</span></a></li>
